### 1. Mengambil Semua Buku
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### 2. Mencari Buku Berdasarkan Keyword Search
GET http://localhost:3000/books?search=Martin

### 3. Mengambil Buku yang Sedang Tersedia Saja
GET http://localhost:3000/books?available=true

### 4. Mengambil Detail Buku ID #1
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1

### 5. Menguji Error 404 pada ID yang Tidak Ada
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999

### 6. Menambah Buku Baru (POST)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Refactoring: Improving the Design of Existing Code",
  "author": "Martin Fowler",
  "isbn": "978-0201485677",
  "publishedYear": 1999
}

### 7. Memperbarui Sebagian Data Buku ID #1 (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isAvailable": false
}

### 8. Menghapus Buku ID #2 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/2
